# Copy this file to .env, then remove the "#" from each setting you fill in.
# Leave unused settings commented out: a setting left empty is still passed to
# the tools harness2 starts, and some of them treat an empty value as an error.
# Shell environment variables take precedence over .env. See docs/SETUP.md.

# --- Google Cloud (Vertex AI) ---
# Project for Vertex AI models. Needed when the executor, improver or judge runs
# on Vertex AI. HARNESS2_VERTEX_PROJECT is read when this is not set.
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=
# Vertex AI region. Defaults to global.
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION=
# Absolute path to a service account key file, as an alternative to
# `gcloud auth application-default login`. gcloud must still be on PATH.
# GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=

# --- Models ---
# Executor model, which runs the task agent, in OpenCode's provider/model
# format, for example google-vertex/<model-id>. Required.
# HARNESS2_SOLVER_MODEL=
# Improver model, which runs the editor, composer, selector and reflector
# agents, in the same format. Defaults to the executor model.
# HARNESS2_IMPROVER_MODEL=
# Judge model, as a bare model ID. Required: harness2 checks it before a run
# starts, because the run records it. Where the judge runs:
#   JobBench: gemini-* IDs run on Vertex AI. Other IDs need the JobBench judge
#     endpoint and key below.
#   LAB: claude-* and gemini-* IDs run on Vertex AI. Other IDs go to the LAB
#     judge's own providers, which read their own credentials.
#   WorkBuddy-Bench: must be a gemini-* ID, on Vertex AI.
# HARNESS2_JUDGE_MODEL=

# --- JobBench judge endpoint (optional) ---
# OpenAI-compatible endpoint for the JobBench judge, used instead of Vertex AI.
# HARNESS2_JUDGE_MODEL is sent to it as written.
# HARNESS2_JUDGE_BASE_URL=
# Key for that endpoint. If this is not set, a gcloud access token is sent
# instead, so set it for any endpoint outside Google.
# HARNESS2_JUDGE_API_KEY=

# --- Codex executor (only with --substrate cx) ---
# harness2-bridge prints the values to use when it starts.
# Model ID the endpoint serves. Defaults to the executor model without its
# provider prefix.
# HARNESS2_CODEX_MODEL=
# Responses API endpoint, as reached from this machine.
# HARNESS2_CODEX_BASE_URL=
# Key for that endpoint.
# HARNESS2_CODEX_API_KEY=
# The same endpoint as reached from inside WorkBuddy-Bench's Docker containers.
# Defaults to HARNESS2_CODEX_BASE_URL.
# HARNESS2_CODEX_CONTAINER_URL=

# --- Output ---
# Folder for results, experience libraries and run records. Defaults to runs/.
# Each benchmark, framework, k and seed gets its own subfolder. That subfolder
# records the models, Google Cloud project and region, judge and Codex
# endpoints, and task selection it was started with, and harness2 refuses to
# continue it with different ones. Set a new folder here when you change any of
# them.
# HARNESS2_RUNS_DIR=
